WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.600
Hey! You wanna shrink down with me&nbsp;
and dance like some different insects?

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.880
Come on, it’ll be fun. Let’s go!

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.364
I’m a praying mantis, snappin'&nbsp;
my arms just like this.&nbsp;

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:19.000
I’m a flashing firefly,&nbsp;
lightin' up the night sky.&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.240
I’m a sneaky spider, spinnin'&nbsp;
my web wider and wider.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:34.314
But what I want, and what I need
is to dance like a bug with a lot of feet!&nbsp;

00:00:34.314 --> 00:00:35.653
(Even more than a centipede!)

00:00:35.653 --> 00:00:40.437
March, march, march, march,
march like a millipede.

00:00:40.437 --> 00:00:41.929
Do the Millipede March.

00:00:41.929 --> 00:00:46.861
March, march, march, march,
march like a millipede.

00:00:46.861 --> 00:00:49.353
Do the Millipede March.

00:00:50.786 --> 00:00:54.192
I’m a jumpy cricket, hoppin' around the thicket.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:02.560
I’m a busy honey bee. Stinger&nbsp;
out, don’t mess with me.&nbsp;

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:10.240
I’m a really pretty butterfly,&nbsp;
makin' my wings open wide.

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:13.120
But what I want, and what I need&nbsp;

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.468
is to dance like a bug with a lot of feet!
(Even more than a centipede!)

00:01:17.468 --> 00:01:22.134
March, march, march, march,
march like a millipede.

00:01:22.134 --> 00:01:23.824
Do the Millipede March.

00:01:23.824 --> 00:01:28.925
March, march, march, march,
march like a millipede.

00:01:28.925 --> 00:01:30.411
Do the Millipede March.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.008
You know, a lot of bugs live&nbsp;
underground. Let’s dig down together!

00:01:34.008 --> 00:01:44.016
dig, dig, dig,  (diggy-diggy)
dig, dig, dig, dig, dig  (diggy-diggy-diggy)

00:01:44.016 --> 00:01:48.200
dig, dig, dig,  (diggy-diggy)
dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig, dig

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:53.760
Whoah, an opening! It looks like someone&nbsp;
lives here. (Sniff) What’s that smell?!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:54.520
It’s a stinkbug!

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:56.440
[Stinkbug: I'm ready to stink!]

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.468
Look out for the stink!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.840
We gotta get outta here!

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:12.868
Alright!

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:17.537
March, march, march, march,
march like a millipede.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:19.501
Do the Millipede March.

00:02:19.478 --> 00:02:24.286
March, march, march, march,
march like a millipede.

00:02:24.286 --> 00:02:25.806
Do the Millipede March.

